TI  - GPS-Based Measurements of Backcountry Visitors in Parks and Protected Areas: Examples of Methods and Applications from Three Case Studies
T2  - JOURNAL OF PARK AND RECREATION ADMINISTRATION
LA  - English
KW  - Global positioning system
