TI  - Independent Effects of Song Quality and Experience with Photostimulation on Expression of the Immediate, Early Gene ZENK (EGR-1) in the Auditory Telencephalon of Female European Starlings
T2  - DEVELOPMENTAL NEUROBIOLOGY
LA  - English
